      "body": "@pitrou can you please share some more detail on what you did to resolve the issue? I am facing the exact same issue when trying to compile cpython from source using `clang-18` with the address sanitizer. I did install `libclang-rt-18-dev`, but that does no seem to help.\r\n\r\nMy configure command looks like this:\r\n\r\n`CC=clang-18 CXX=clang++-18 ../configure --with-pymalloc --with-assertions --with-address-sanitizer --with-undefined-behavior-sanitizer --with-memory-sanitizer --with-pydebug --disable-ipv6 -C`\r\n",
