      "updated_at": "2024-10-02T09:17:33Z",
      "body": "Since I stumbled across this issue when facing the same problem:\r\n\r\n> `CC=clang-18 CXX=clang++-18 ../configure --with-pymalloc --with-assertions --with-address-sanitizer --with-undefined-behavior-sanitizer --with-memory-sanitizer --with-pydebug --disable-ipv6 -C`\r\n\r\nYou cannot combine `--with-address-sanitizer` and `--with-memory-sanitizer`. Maybe `configure` should check this and throw an error?",
